# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Boss, 0.8.11: "Now I am seeing double icons... and then I tried to do tap backs on other messages, and some of them did not even register."
# Isolated DEMO fixtures only, behind tools/walkthrough/messages-own-handle-proxy.py at 12 s: the Mac names his reactions by another of his
# handles, fromMe false, as the live service did, and has them late, as chat.db does. INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN, INJECT_DEMO_HOST, INJECT_DEMO_PORT.
fold folded
wait 1200
shell cmd statusbar collapse
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2FINJECT_DEMO_HOST%3AINJECT_DEMO_PORT&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
tap Link
wait 20000
expect Ana Demo
tap Ana Demo
wait 1500
expect Perfect, see you there
# His first, then a switch to another: one chip for him the whole way.
clearlog
doubletap Perfect, see you there
tap Tapback laugh
log tapback shown me:laugh
wait 1500
doubletap Perfect, see you there
tap Tapback emphasize
log tapback shown me:emphasize
# The Mac's copy, late, under his other handle.
wait 14000
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
nolog tapback doubled
nolog tapback left
shot switched-one-chip card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
# A tap on the chip itself takes it off at once, with no menu. Reopening while the Mac still has it doesn't bring it back, nor does the Mac's copy after.
clearlog
tap Remove your reaction, emphasize
log tapback left
absent People who reacted
absent Remove your reaction, emphasize
shot chip-tapped-off card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
absent Remove your reaction, emphasize
nolog tapback shown
wait 14000
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
absent Remove your reaction, emphasize
nolog tapback shown
shot chip-stays-off card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
# Fast across other messages: each tap leaves its reaction.
clearlog
doubletap Are we still on for dinner?
tap Tapback laugh
doubletap Edit this demo message
tap Tapback question
log tapback shown me:laugh
log tapback shown me:question
wait 14000
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
nolog tapback doubled
nolog tapback left
shot fast-across-messages card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
# His and someone else's of the same kind: a tap removes only his.
doubletap Yes! 7pm
tap Tapback love
wait 14000
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2500
expect Remove your reaction, love
expect Reaction on: Yes! 7pm
shot his-and-hers card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
clearlog
tap Remove your reaction, love
wait 1500
expect Reaction on: Yes! 7pm
shot only-his-removed card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
# Someone else's icon does nothing.
tap Reaction on: Yes! 7pm
wait 1000
absent People who reacted
expect Reaction on: Yes! 7pm
shot someone-elses-icon-does-nothing card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
